<title>USA: Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps Q1 primary shr $0.06.</title>
<headline>Phoenix Duff &amp; Phelps Q1 primary shr $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>						   Mar 31,	Mar 31,</p>
<p>						    1997	   1996</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p> Revenues				    $ 35,886	$ 41,185</p>
<p> Net earnings				   3,759	   7,113</p>
